  "id": "song",
  "term": "song",
  "definition": "In this context, song is a vocal communication signal produced by songbirds that carries information relevant to mate choice and social recognition. Its features can distinguish species and the condition or social context of the singer, and experience can shape how females learn to recognize and prefer particular songs.",
